            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 52,
              "start": 52
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justices raised questions about the reviewability of the agency\u2019s action and the limiting principles that govern such review."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6462e834951c2781b570be865b133f4f2b2736c67fb80dc0a6c73d1efb857c9f",
